, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><br></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><b style="text-indent: 0px;"><font color="#000066"><u>Priority Rating Details:</u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><font color="#000066">Strategy Fit:</font>&nbsp;</b></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Opportunity.Strategy_Priority__c}</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><font color="#000066">Delivery Fit:</font>&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial"><b>{!Opportunity.Delivery_Fit__c}</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><b><font color="#000066">Sales Fit:&nbsp;</font></b><font face="arial"><b>{!Opportunity.Sales_Fit__c}</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><font color="#000066">SE Fit:</font>&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial"><b>{!Opportunity.Priority__c}</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1.25in; text-indent: -1.25in; vertical-align: middle;"><b style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px;"><